**Rescuers of the Kyiv Emergency Rescue Service work every day to clean up the consequences of Russia’s military aggression in Kyiv and the surrounding region, in addition to taking calls from citizens around the clock. Work to clear the debris of the roof from this high-rise residential building is now on its third day.

